<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Payment Success</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{

height:100vh;

display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;

overflow:hidden;

background:
linear-gradient(
rgba(0,0,0,.88),
rgba(0,0,0,.92)
),

url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511512578047-dfb367046420?q=80&w=1200');

background-size:cover;
background-position:center;

color:white;
}

.glow{

position:absolute;

width:500px;
height:500px;

background:
radial-gradient(
circle,
rgba(250,204,21,.2),
transparent 70%
);

filter:blur(50px);

animation:pulse 3s infinite;
}

@keyframes pulse{

0%{
transform:scale(1);
opacity:.5;
}

50%{
transform:scale(1.2);
opacity:1;
}

100%{
transform:scale(1);
opacity:.5;
}

}

.box{

position:relative;

z-index:2;

width:500px;

padding:50px;

border-radius:30px;

text-align:center;

background:
rgba(15,15,15,.78);

backdrop-filter:blur(15px);

border:
1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);

animation:fadeUp 1s ease;
}

@keyframes fadeUp{

from{
opacity:0;
transform:translateY(50px);
}

to{
opacity:1;
transform:translateY(0);
}

}

.icon{

font-size:95px;

margin-bottom:20px;

animation:float 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes float{

0%{
transform:translateY(0);
}

50%{
transform:translateY(-12px);
}

100%{
transform:translateY(0);
}

}

h1{

font-size:45px;

margin-bottom:15px;

color:#facc15;
}

p{

font-size:18px;

line-height:1.8;

color:#ddd;

margin-bottom:35px;
}

.btn{

display:inline-block;

padding:16px 34px;

border-radius:18px;

text-decoration:none;

font-weight:600;

font-size:17px;

color:white;

background:
linear-gradient(
135deg,
#9333ea,
#6b21a8
);

transition:.3s;
}

.btn:hover{

transform:scale(1.05);

box-shadow:
0 0 25px rgba(147,51,234,.35);
}

.spark{

position:absolute;

width:10px;
height:10px;

border-radius:50%;

background:#facc15;

animation:spark 4s linear infinite;
}

.spark:nth-child(1){
top:10%;
left:15%;
animation-delay:0s;
}

.spark:nth-child(2){
top:20%;
right:18%;
animation-delay:1s;
}

.spark:nth-child(3){
bottom:15%;
left:20%;
animation-delay:2s;
}

.spark:nth-child(4){
bottom:20%;
right:15%;
animation-delay:3s;
}

@keyframes spark{

0%{
transform:translateY(0) scale(1);
opacity:0;
}

50%{
opacity:1;
}

100%{
transform:translateY(-80px) scale(1.8);
opacity:0;
}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="glow"></div>

<div class="spark"></div>
<div class="spark"></div>
<div class="spark"></div>
<div class="spark"></div>

<div class="box">

<div class="icon">
🔮✨
</div>

<h1>
Payment Berhasil
</h1>

<p>

Ritual berhasil dibayar 💰<br>
Dukun sedang memproses energi mistismu...

</p>

<a
href="/home"
class="btn">

Kembali ke Home

</a>

</div>

</body>
</html>